---
// Transformations.astro - Verified Performance Case Studies
---

<section class="section transformations-section section-border-top" id="transformations" aria-label="Member Case Studies and Performance Transformations">
  <div class="container">
    <!-- Header -->
    <div class="trans-header">
      <div>
        <div class="editorial-badge">
          <span>06 // VERIFIED ATHLETE DATA</span>
        </div>
        <h2 class="section-title-huge">
          FORGED UNDER <span class="text-accent">LOAD.</span>
        </h2>
        <p class="section-lead">
          Real athletes, real data. We track objective physiological markers: compound force output, lactate clearance, lean tissue composition, and biomechanical durability.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="trans-metric-stamp">
        <span class="stamp-title">AVERAGE 90-DAY LIFT GAIN</span>
        <span class="stamp-val text-accent">+35-65 KG</span>
        <span class="stamp-sub">ACROSS BIG 3 POWER LIFTS</span>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Case Studies Grid -->
    <div class="trans-grid">
      <!-- Case 01 -->
      <article class="case-card">
        <div class="case-header">
          <div class="case-badge">CASE STUDY // 01</div>
          <div class="case-duration">6 MONTH PERIODIZATION</div>
        </div>

        <div class="case-body">
          <div class="case-quote-box">
            <p class="case-quote">
              "I spent years suffering desk-bound lumbar pain. Alex rebuilt my hip mechanics and spinal bracing. Today I deadlift 220kg pain-free."
            </p>
          </div>

          <div class="case-athlete-meta">
            <h3 class="athlete-name">DAVID VANCE</h3>
            <span class="athlete-role">MANAGING PARTNER // AGE 38</span>
          </div>

          <!-- Verified Performance Metrics -->
          <div class="case-metrics-grid">
            <div class="metric-item">
              <span class="m-label">DEADLIFT MAX</span>
              <span class="m-val text-white">120kg → <strong class="text-accent">220kg</strong></span>
              <span class="m-change text-accent">(+100 KG)</span>
            </div>
            <div class="metric-item">
              <span class="m-label">BODY FAT RECOMP</span>
              <span class="m-val text-white">24% → <strong class="text-accent">14.2%</strong></span>
              <span class="m-change text-accent">(-9.8%)</span>
            </div>
            <div class="metric-item">
              <span class="m-label">PRIMARY DISCIPLINE</span>
              <span class="m-val text-white">Heavy Iron & Rehab</span>
              <span class="m-change">4x / WEEK</span>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </article>

      <!-- Case 02 -->
      <article class="case-card featured-case">
        <div class="case-header">
          <div class="case-badge text-accent">CASE STUDY // 02 • HYROX PODIUM</div>
          <div class="case-duration">16 WEEKS</div>
        </div>

        <div class="case-body">
          <div class="case-quote-box">
            <p class="case-quote">
              "Most commercial gyms have zero equipment for actual hybrid athletes. Iron Forge’s 60m turf, heavy sleds, and high-density intervals took 14 minutes off my race."
            </p>
          </div>

          <div class="case-athlete-meta">
            <h3 class="athlete-name">SARAH JENKINS</h3>
            <span class="athlete-role">HYROX PRO COMPETITOR // AGE 29</span>
          </div>

          <!-- Verified Performance Metrics -->
          <div class="case-metrics-grid">
            <div class="metric-item">
              <span class="m-label">HYROX RACE TIME</span>
              <span class="m-val text-white">1h 18m → <strong class="text-accent">1h 04m</strong></span>
              <span class="m-change text-accent">(-14 MIN)</span>
            </div>
            <div class="metric-item">
              <span class="m-label">FRONT SQUAT 1RM</span>
              <span class="m-val text-white">75kg → <strong class="text-accent">115kg</strong></span>
              <span class="m-change text-accent">(+40 KG)</span>
            </div>
            <div class="metric-item">
              <span class="m-label">PRIMARY DISCIPLINE</span>
              <span class="m-val text-white">Functional Hybrid Engine</span>
              <span class="m-change">5x / WEEK</span>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </article>

      <!-- Case 03 -->
      <article class="case-card">
        <div class="case-header">
          <div class="case-badge">CASE STUDY // 03</div>
          <div class="case-duration">9 MONTH PROGRAM</div>
        </div>

        <div class="case-body">
          <div class="case-quote-box">
            <p class="case-quote">
              "The training culture here eliminates distraction. When everyone around you is moving heavy weight with surgical focus, you can't help but elevate."
            </p>
          </div>

          <div class="case-athlete-meta">
            <h3 class="athlete-name">MARCUS BRODY</h3>
            <span class="athlete-role">FORMER NCAA ATHLETE // AGE 34</span>
          </div>

          <!-- Verified Performance Metrics -->
          <div class="case-metrics-grid">
            <div class="metric-item">
              <span class="m-label">BENCH PRESS 1RM</span>
              <span class="m-val text-white">140kg → <strong class="text-accent">185kg</strong></span>
              <span class="m-change text-accent">(+45 KG)</span>
            </div>
            <div class="metric-item">
              <span class="m-label">LEAN TISSUE ACCRETION</span>
              <span class="m-val text-white">InBody: <strong class="text-accent">+8.4kg</strong></span>
              <span class="m-change text-accent">(VERIFIED)</span>
            </div>
            <div class="metric-item">
              <span class="m-label">PRIMARY DISCIPLINE</span>
              <span class="m-val text-white">Hypertrophy & Heavy Iron</span>
              <span class="m-change">4x / WEEK</span>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </article>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .transformations-section {
    background-color: var(--bg-deep);
    position: relative;
  }

  .trans-header {
    display: flex;
    justify-content: space-between;
    align-items: flex-end;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    gap: 2rem;
    margin-bottom: 3.5rem;
  }

  .trans-metric-stamp {
    background: var(--bg-surface);
    border: 1px solid var(--border-medium);
    border-left: 3px solid var(--accent-primary);
    padding: 1rem 1.5rem;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
  }

  .stamp-title {
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 0.65rem;
    color: var(--text-muted);
    letter-spacing: 0.1em;
  }

  .stamp-val {
    font-family: var(--font-display);
    font-size: 2.2rem;
    line-height: 1;
    margin: 0.2rem 0;
  }

  .stamp-sub {
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 0.62rem;
    color: var(--text-body);
    letter-spacing: 0.08em;
  }

  /* Grid */
  .trans-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);
    gap: 2rem;
  }

  .case-card {
    background-color: var(--bg-surface);
    border: 1px solid var(--border-subtle);
    padding: 2rem 1.75rem;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    justify-content: space-between;
    transition: transform var(--transition-normal), border-color var(--transition-normal), box-shadow var(--transition-normal);
  }

  .case-card:hover {
    transform: translateY(-4px);
    border-color: var(--border-accent);
    box-shadow: 0 15px 35px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.5);
  }

  .featured-case {
    border-color: var(--border-accent);
    background-color: var(--bg-card);
  }

  .case-header {
    display: flex;
    justify-content: space-between;
    align-items: center;
    padding-bottom: 1.25rem;
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border-subtle);
    margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
  }

  .case-badge {
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 0.72rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    color: var(--text-white);
    letter-spacing: 0.1em;
  }

  .case-duration {
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 0.65rem;
    color: var(--text-muted);
    letter-spacing: 0.08em;
  }

  .case-quote-box {
    margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
  }

  .case-quote {
    font-size: 0.95rem;
    line-height: 1.6;
    color: var(--text-white);
    font-style: italic;
  }

  .case-athlete-meta {
    padding-bottom: 1.25rem;
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border-subtle);
    margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
  }

  .athlete-name {
    font-family: var(--font-display);
    font-size: 1.45rem;
    color: var(--text-white);
    letter-spacing: 0.04em;
    line-height: 1;
    margin-bottom: 0.25rem;
  }

  .athlete-role {
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 0.68rem;
    color: var(--accent-primary);
    letter-spacing: 0.08em;
  }

  .case-metrics-grid {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 0.85rem;
  }

  .metric-item {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 0.2rem;
    background: rgba(8, 9, 11, 0.4);
    padding: 0.65rem 0.85rem;
    border-left: 2px solid var(--border-medium);
  }

  .m-label {
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 0.62rem;
    color: var(--text-muted);
    letter-spacing: 0.08em;
  }

  .m-val {
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 0.85rem;
  }

  .m-change {
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 0.65rem;
    font-weight: 700;
  }

  .text-accent {
    color: var(--accent-primary);
  }

  .text-white {
    color: var(--text-white);
  }

  /* Responsive Media Queries */
  @media (max-width: 1100px) {
    .trans-grid {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    }
  }

  @media (max-width: 640px) {
    .trans-header {
      flex-direction: column;
      align-items: flex-start;
    }
    .case-card {
      padding: 1.5rem 1.25rem;
    }
  }
</style>
